        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Build PDF HTML').item.json.name }},</p><p>Your personalised cover letter and resume summary for <b>{{ $('Build PDF HTML').item.json.job_title }}</b> are attached as a PDF.</p><p><b>Resume summary preview:</b><br>{{ $('Build PDF HTML').item.json.resume_summary }}</p><p>Tip: read it once and adjust anything that doesn't sound like you before sending.</p><p>Good luck! 🚀<br>AI Job Application Assistant</p>",
